    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hamster Clicker!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Hamster Clicker \u2014 a fun and engaging clicker that will steal your heart! Help the adorable hamster girl collect coins and unlock new outfits in this dynamic adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/0ec8bf42dda4b91cbd0fed8d1a1b4034.poster.avif?t=1727530833\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/0ec8bf42dda4b91cbd0fed8d1a1b4034.webm?t=1727530833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/0ec8bf42dda4b91cbd0fed8d1a1b4034.mp4?t=1727530833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a faraway magical forest, there lives a hamster girl who dreams of becoming the happiest and most successful in her world. Together with you, she will collect coins and acquire new outfits, becoming more beautiful with each step. Help her on this incredible journey and become a true clicker master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT YOUR COLLECTION OF HAMSTERS!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/76e67defe731c845407a1559efd1adc5.avif?t=1727530833\" width=520 height=205 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive gameplay: Easy to learn, hard to put down! Simply tap the screen to collect coins and help your hamster girl grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system: Unlock new outfits and items for your character as you progress through levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and animation: Enjoy high-quality animation and charming character design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet engaging progression: Pass through numerous levels, each offering new outfits and items for your hamster girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends: Surpass your friends and players worldwide by climbing to the top of the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop: Purchase various items in the shop to make your hamster girl even more attractive.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hamster Clicker!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Hamster Clicker \u2014 a fun and engaging clicker that will steal your heart! Help the adorable hamster girl collect coins and unlock new outfits in this dynamic adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/0ec8bf42dda4b91cbd0fed8d1a1b4034.poster.avif?t=1727530833\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/0ec8bf42dda4b91cbd0fed8d1a1b4034.webm?t=1727530833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/0ec8bf42dda4b91cbd0fed8d1a1b4034.mp4?t=1727530833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a faraway magical forest, there lives a hamster girl who dreams of becoming the happiest and most successful in her world. Together with you, she will collect coins and acquire new outfits, becoming more beautiful with each step. Help her on this incredible journey and become a true clicker master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT YOUR COLLECTION OF HAMSTERS!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858910/extras/76e67defe731c845407a1559efd1adc5.avif?t=1727530833\" width=520 height=205 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive gameplay: Easy to learn, hard to put down! Simply tap the screen to collect coins and help your hamster girl grow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system: Unlock new outfits and items for your character as you progress through levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and animation: Enjoy high-quality animation and charming character design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet engaging progression: Pass through numerous levels, each offering new outfits and items for your hamster girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends: Surpass your friends and players worldwide by climbing to the top of the global leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop: Purchase various items in the shop to make your hamster girl even more attractive.</p></li></ul>",
